-id=\"e87d014\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/hdmarine.com.tr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/hd-mar13-300x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium wp-image-398\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/hdmarine.com.tr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/hd-mar13-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/hdmarine.com.tr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/hd-mar13-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/hdmarine.com.tr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/hd-mar13-100x100.jpg 100w, https:\/\/hdmarine.com.tr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/hd-mar13.jpg 500w\" sizes=\"100vw\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d9d4dda e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"d9d4dda\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8cd776a e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"8cd776a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-956a3a3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"956a3a3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Dişli pompalar<\/strong>, pozitif deplasmanlı çalışması sayesinde her devride sabit miktarda sıvı transferi sağlayan mekanik pompalar olarak endüstriyel sistemlerde sıklıkla tercih edilir. Bu özellikleriyle özellikle viskoz (yoğun) sıvıların taşınmasında yüksek performans ve güvenilirlik sunar.<\/p><p>Dişli pompalar, <strong>yüksek basınçlı transfer<\/strong>, <strong>düşük debi uygulamaları<\/strong> ve <strong>sürekli akış kontrolü gereken sistemler<\/strong> için ideal çözümlerdir. Bu pompalar içlerindeki dişli çarklar vasıtasıyla sıvıyı emer, basınçlandırır ve istikrarlı şekilde sistem hattına iletir.<\/p><p>HD Marine dişli pompalar, geniş viskozite aralığındaki sıvıları problemsiz şekilde transfer edebilme kapasitesi ile endüstriyel tesislerden üretim hatlarına kadar çeşitli uygulamalarda etkinlik sağlar.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-364f733 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"364f733\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-831b894 elementor-view-stacked elementor-position-inline-start elementor-tablet-position-inline-end elementor-shape-circle elementor-mobile-position-block-start elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"831b894\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<span  class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-table\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M464 32H48C21.49 32 0 53.49 0 80v352c0 26.51 21.49 48 48 48h416c26.51 0 48-21.49 48-48V80c0-26.51-21.49-48-48-48zM224 416H64v-96h160v96zm0-160H64v-96h160v96zm224 160H288v-96h160v96zm0-160H288v-96h160v96z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDişli Pompa Teknik Değer Tablosu\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/h3>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5b4a5df elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5b4a5df\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table width=\"514\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"185\">Özellik<\/td><td width=\"329\">Değer<\/td><\/tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Pompa Tipi<\/td><td width=\"329\">Pozitif Deplasmanlı Dişli Pompa<\/td><\/tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Debi Aralığı<\/td><td width=\"329\">1 – 200 L\/dk<\/td><\/tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Maksimum Basınç<\/td><td width=\"329\">6 – 25 bar<\/td><\/tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Viskozite Aralığı<\/td><td width=\"329\">10 – 250.000 cP<\/td><\/tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Motor Gücü<\/td><td width=\"329\">0.37 – 5.5 kW<\/td><\/tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Bağlantı Çapı<\/td><td width=\"329\">½” – 2”<\/td><\/tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Gövde Malzemesi<\/td><td width=\"329\">Döküm \/ Paslanmaz Çelik<\/td><\/tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Mil Sızdırmazlık<\/td><td width=\"329\">Mekanik Salmastra<\/td><\/tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Çalışma Sıcaklığı<\/td><td width=\"329\">-10°C \/ +180°C<\/td><\/tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Montaj Tipi<\/td><td width=\"329\">Yatay<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1cc96c8 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1cc96c8\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4e37b6d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"4e37b6d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-80f80a1 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"80f80a1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elem